<title>FINLAND: KASOLA SWINGS TO 4-MTH PROFIT.</title>
<headline>KASOLA SWINGS TO 4-MTH PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to August 31- </p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p>Profit before extraordinary items, tax 1.48 vs 1.90 loss</p>
<p> Net sales				     29.96 vs 34.15</p>
<p> Operating profit			     2.64 vs 0.48 loss</p>
<p> Net profit				     0.53 vs 1.98 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish safe and safety device maker is</p>
<p>Kasola Oy.</p>
